// Event volume by process (triage baseline)
//
// Aggregates auth and authpriv events by process and severity. Useful as a
// first-look triage view: establishes a normal baseline and makes a sudden
// spike in su, sudo, or sshd stand out.
//
// Doubles as a sanity check on the collection scope. Only processes tied to
// the auth and authpriv facilities should appear here, since those are the
// only two facilities the Data Collection Rule was set to collect.

Syslog
| summarize Events = count() by ProcessName, SeverityLevel
| order by Events desc
